        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion AH-D6, Clawfoot Lever with Victorian Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe unique shape of the Clawfoot Lever paired with the ornate Victorian Plate brings to mind the medieval world. Positively dripping with antique beauty, this Fusion Hardware made knob and plate set is a perfect addition for anyone who wants to add the richness of the old world to their homes while still maintaining an omnipresence that allows it to span the chasms of ever-changing style trends. It is finished in oil rubbed bronze. It will fit 1-1/4 inch to 2 inch thick doors and has an optional 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available <a href=\"/products/victorian-entry-plate-fusion-e-d6\"><b>Matching Keyed Entry Plate</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Fusion AH-D6 Clawfoot Lever and Victorian Plate Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid Brass/Bronze Construction</li>\r\n<li>Cycle Tested to ANSI Standards</li>\r\n<li>”Positive Stop” lever spring mechanism</li>\r\n<li>Reversible Latchbolt in matching/coordinating finish</li>\r\n<li>Easy assembly with alignment block and rose posts</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Ornate Door Lever Fusion AH D6:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length:  4-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection:  2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Escutcheon Height:  11\"</li>\r\n<li>Escutcheon Width:  3-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: Either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass or Bronze</li>\r\n<li>Standard Latch Rotation is 40 Degrees.</li>\r\n<li>Square corner latches and strike plates </li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on one side of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on both sides of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Clawfoot Lever With Victorian Plate, Fusion AH-D6",
                "description": "Clawfoot Lever with Victorian Plate Fusion AH D6 - The unique shape of the Clawfoot Lever paired with the ornate Victorian Plate brings to mind the medieval world. Positively dripping with antique beauty, this Fusion Hardware made knob and rose set is a perfect addition for anyone who wants to add the richness of the old world to their homes while still maintaining an omnipresence that allows it to span the chasms of ever-changing style trends.  It will fit 1-1/4 inch to 2 inch thick doors and can be adjusted for either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.It is finished in oil rubbed bronze.",
